oofs, intricate wooden brackets, glowing lanterns, stone tables and chairs in the foreground, and a misty, moonlit atmosphere in the background. This scene is strictly derived from <Picture 3> and remains fully preserved throughout the video.\nsummary:\nreference generation\nretention_analysis:\nCharacter identity (<Subject 1> and <Subject 2>): fully_preserved\nShared environment (<Subject 3>): fully_preserved\nCostume and accessories: fully_preserved\nAction, motion trajectory, and temporal structure from <Video 1>: fully_preserved within the motion-only role\nCamera movement and framing from <Video 1>: reference for motion dynamics, adapted to the target scene\nLip sync and facial animation: not transferred (silent performer)\ndetailed_description:\nThe video opens in the shared environment <Subject 3>, the misty, lantern-lit courtyard of the ancient Chinese building at night. The shot begins with a medium-full shot of the orc guard <Subject 2> standing near the stone tables, letting out a massive, slow yawn, his heavy body relaxing.\nThe camera then smoothly cuts and tilts up to the ornate curved roof eaves of the building. The female protagonist <Subject 1> drops into the frame from above. She lands lightly on the roof, immediately springs upward into a high, graceful aerial jump, executes a series of rapid, fluid somersaults in mid-air, and descends with precision. She lands in a deep, balanced crouch directly on the back of the yawning guard <Subject 2>. In one continuous, sharp motion, she draws a sleek black blade and thrusts it downward into his back armor.\nFollowing this impact, the camera dynamically shifts to a tracking shot, closely following the protagonist <Subject 1> as she pushes off the guard and sprints forward across the stone courtyard. The camera movement mimics the energetic, forward-rushing momentum of <Video 1>, keeping her centered while the background blurs slightly with speed. Ahead in the deep background, another orc guard <Subject 2> charges toward her to block her path. Without breaking stride, the protagonist drops her center of gravity low, executing a swift, sliding dash that glides perfectly underneath the charging guard's legs.\nAs she rises from the slide and continues running, three more orc guards <Subject 2> emerge from the deep background, rushing toward her. She leaps high into the air with explosive power, clearing their reach, and lands smoothly to continue sprinting into the distance. The shot scale and camera distance adapt dynamically to accommodate these full-body actions, transitioning from medium shots to wider tracking shots as needed, while strictly maintaining the character proportions and visual style defined in <Picture 1> and <Picture 2>. The lighting remains consistent with the moody, lantern-lit night atmosphere of <Subject 3>.\nThe performer remains silent throughout. Her lips stay gently closed, her jaw remains naturally relaxed, and her teeth and tongue stay hidden. Natural blinking, gaze changes, head turns, and breathing are allowed, but no speaking or singing occurs.\noverall_soundscape:\nThe soundscape features the ambient night sounds of the ancient courtyard: a gentle breeze rustling through the trees, the soft flicker of lantern flames, and the distant, muffled sounds of the city. Physical sounds include the heavy, grunting yawn of the orc guard, the sharp metallic ring of the blade striking armor, the rapid, rhythmic thud of the protagonist's footsteps on the stone pavement, the swoosh of her sliding dash, and the heavy, charging footsteps of the pursuing guards.\nnon_diegetic_music:\nNo non-diegetic music is required. The scene relies entirely on the immersive environmental and physical sound effects to drive the tension and pacing of the action sequence.", 1344, 768, 124, "match"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 373, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 374, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name"